    "title": "Supply Chain Manager - Mahindra Navistar - Growth Opportunity",
    "description": "Grow your career with Mahindra Navistar! We are hiring a Supply Chain Manager for our Bhopal team. Be part of a workplace that celebrates innovation, diversity, and performance.\n\nAbout Mahindra Navistar:\nMahindra Navistar is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Coordinate with warehousing teams for inbound and outbound operations\n• Manage reverse logistics and return merchandise authorization\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Ensure compliance with transportation regulations and safety standards\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• CA / CMA / CFA certification\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Vendor Management\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in INCOTERMS\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in Reverse Logistics\n• Proficiency in Customs Clearance\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Learning & development budget\n• Referral bonus program\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mahindra Navistar!",
